'''Budding Expeditioner''' (Japanese: '''かけだし調査員''' ''Novice Researcher'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put your {{DL|Mew (TCG Pocket)|Mew ex|Mew '''''<big>ex</big>'''''}} in the Active Spot into your hand.
}}

