==Trivia==
===Origin===
This character is original to TCG Pocket, but they seem to be an example of someone who searches for {{p|Mew}}, only for it to disappear or teleport away upon being approached. This is demonstrated by the special illustration rare of {{TCG ID|Mythical Island|Mew ex|83}} depicting Mew sitting in the rubble right behind where the Budding Expeditioner is standing.

